            "review_title": "Review at La Bodega",
            "review_text": "Christian P\n16 contributions\n0\n\"THE\" Italian Restaurant in Hoi An\nJul 2025 • Family\nBest Italian restaurant in Hoi An. Owners, Manager and Chef are from Italy. Made in an imported Italian owen, the pizzas (e) are as good or better than in Italy. Spaghetti and pasta are fantastic. Extemely nice Italian atmosphere with ma favorite songs: \"Ragazzi della la via Gluck\" and \"Felicita\", that I enjoyed with un \"cafe coretto sambucca\"\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 27, 2025",
